<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">

<head th:replace="~{fragments/layout :: html_head('Acessar Painel - Bidding System')}"></head>

<body class="bg-light">

    <div class="container-fluid p-0">
        <div class="row g-0 vh-100">
            
            <div class="col-lg-6 d-none d-lg-flex bg-primary bg-gradient flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center text-white p-5 shadow">
                <i class="bi bi-shield-lock display-1 mb-3"></i>
                <h1 class="fw-bold mb-3 display-4">Bem-vindo de Volta</h1>
                <p class="lead text-center px-5 fw-light">
                    Acesse o painel eletrônico de licitações para acompanhar seus processos ativos, enviar propostas e gerenciar seus lances em tempo real.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6 d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center bg-white shadow-lg">
                <div class="w-100" style="max-width: 440px; padding: 2rem;">
                    
                    <div class="text-center mb-4">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-lock fs-1 text-primary d-lg-none mb-2"></i>
                        <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark">Acessar Painel</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted small">Insira suas credenciais abaixo para continuar</p>
                    </div>

                    <div th:if="${erro}" class="alert alert-danger d-flex align-items-center shadow-sm" role="alert">
                        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2 fs-5"></i>
                        <span th:text="${erro}">E-mail ou senha incorretos.</span>
                    </div>

                    <form th:action="@{/login}" method="post">
                        
                        <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                            <input type="email" class="form-control focus-ring focus-ring-primary" id="emailInput" name="username" placeholder="nome@empresa.com" required autocomplete="email">
                            <label for="emailInput" class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-envelope me-2"></i>E-mail Corporativo</label>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="form-floating mb-3">
                            <input type="password" class="form-control focus-ring focus-ring-primary" id="senhaInput" name="password" placeholder="••••••••" required autocomplete="current-password">
                            <label for="senhaInput" class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-lock me-2"></i>Senha de Acesso</label>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4">
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input shadow-sm" type="checkbox" id="lembrarMim">
                                <label class="form-check-label text-muted small" for="lembrarMim">
                                    Lembrar-me
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <a href="#" class="text-decoration-none small fw-semibold">Esqueceu a senha?</a>
                        </div>

                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg w-100 fw-bold shadow-sm d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center gap-2">
                            Entrar no Sistema <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i>
                        </button>
                        
                    </form>

                    <div class="text-center mt-4 text-muted" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
                        Novo por aqui? <a th:href="@{/register}" class="text-decoration-none fw-bold">Criar uma conta gratuita</a>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>